 COMPLETED: [N/N]
-FAILED: [count]
-
-EXECUTION SUMMARY:
-- Task 1: SUCCESS (category)
-- Task 2: SUCCESS (agent)
-
-FILES MODIFIED:
-[list]
-
-ACCUMULATED WISDOM:
-[from notepad]
+FINAL WAVE: F1 [APPROVE] | F2 [APPROVE] | F3 [APPROVE] | F4 [APPROVE]
+FILES MODIFIED: [list]
 \`\`\`
 </workflow>
 
